## Task 2 — Address List View

### Desktop Table Layout (md: and above)

```
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| Clock-In Addresses                    [+ Add Address] [Import ▼]         |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| [Search: _______________]  Filter: [All ▼] [Active ▼]                   |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| Label          | Address              | Radius | Project | Source | Active|
|----------------|----------------------|--------|---------|--------|-------|
| Main Office    | 123 Main St, Boston  | 100m   | —       | Manual | Yes  |
| Job Site #1    | 456 Oak Ave, Newton  | 150m   | Proj A  | Quote  | Yes  |
| Warehouse      | 789 Elm Rd, Waltham  | 200m   | —       | Lead   | No   |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| [< Prev]  Page 1 of 2  [Next >]                                         |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Mobile Card Layout (below md:)

```
+------------------------------------------+
| Main Office                    [Active]  |
| 123 Main St, Boston, MA 02101           |
| Radius: 100m | Project: Any             |
| Source: Manual                           |
| [Edit] [Deactivate]                     |
+------------------------------------------+
```

### Table Columns

| Column | Content | Component |
|--------|---------|-----------|
| Label | `{label}` | Bold text |
| Address | `{address_line1}, {city}, {state} {zip_code}` | Plain text, truncated with tooltip for full address |
| Radius | `{radius_meters}m` | Plain text |
| Project | Project name if linked, "Any Project" if `project_id === null` | Badge or plain text |
| Source | `Manual` / `From Quote` / `From Lead` | `Badge` with variant: manual=neutral, quote=info, lead=info |
| Active | "Active" (success Badge) or "Inactive" (neutral Badge) | `Badge` |
| Actions | Edit, Deactivate/Activate buttons | `Button` icons |

### Filters

- **Search:** Text input with debounce (300ms), filters by label or address
- **Active filter:** `Select` with options: "All", "Active Only", "Inactive Only" — maps to `is_active` query param
- **Project filter:** (Optional) `Select` dropdown of projects to filter by `project_id`

### Pagination

- Use `PaginationControls` component
- Default page size: 20

### Empty State

```
[MapPin icon]
No Clock-In Addresses
Add addresses to enforce geofence-based clock-in for your team.
[+ Add Address]
```

