## Task 7 — Soft Delete (Deactivate)

**Trigger:** "Deactivate" button on each active row/card. "Activate" button on inactive rows (if re-activation is supported via PATCH).

### Deactivate Flow

1. Click "Deactivate" button
2. Show `ConfirmModal`:
   - Title: "Deactivate Address"
   - Message: "Deactivate '{address.label}'? This address will no longer be used for geofence enforcement. You can reactivate it later."
3. On confirm: Call `deleteClockinAddress(id)` (the backend soft-deletes by setting `is_active = false`)
4. On success: toast "Address deactivated", refresh list
5. On error: toast error message

### Reactivation (Optional)

If the backend supports reactivation via PATCH:
- Show "Activate" button on inactive addresses
- On click: Call `updateClockinAddress(id, { is_active: true })`
- Toast "Address activated", refresh list

If unsure whether the backend supports this, test it in Task 1 and implement accordingly.

